<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43894" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐήθ-εια</span></b> , poet. also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐηθία</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ιη</span>, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>goodness of heart,
			guilelessness</i>, generally in ironical sense, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάνυ γενναίαν εὐ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				348c
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				D.
				24.52
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Com.Adesp.</u>
				773
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δἰ εὐηθίην</span> by his
				<i>good nature</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				3.139
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> in bad sense,
				<i>simplicity, silliness</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐς τοσοῦτο εὐηθίης ἀνήκει τοῦτο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					7.16
				</span></i>
			.<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γ́</span>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				1.60
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κουφόνους εὐηθία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					385
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνωφελὴς εὐηθίᾳ . . γυνή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Hipp.</u>
					639
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολλῆς -είας, ὅστις οἴεται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					3.45
				</span></i>
			; -
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ειάν τινος καταγιγνώσκειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lys.
					26.2
				</span></i>
			.</div>
